title: Staging the same change twice, then a line with no change (1): the second and third say there is nothing to stage, index holds only line 39's change
folders: git-changes
expect-file: git-changes/src/steps.rs :: let two = 2;\n    two\n\}\n[\s\S]*step_5\(\) -> u32 \{\n    5\n\}\n\nfn step_7[\s\S]*eleven\(\)
forbid-log: script: ignoring

wait 3000
left changes
goto src/steps.rs
wait 1000
zoom 0.5
wait 600
part stage src/steps.rs 39
wait 1500
part stage src/steps.rs 39
wait 1500
mark twice
wait 600
part stage src/steps.rs 1
wait 1500
mark end
wait 600
quit
